      "mergedPostDetails": "Forced Camera Near Distance setting isn't always applying directly. changing it from forced to anything isn't applying the setting.\n\n1. Go to a world, ex: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_38646e89-6117-48a9-aab9-aea64c1cd629\n\n2. Look at the skybox\n\n3. change Forced Camera Near Distance to Forced (if it isn't yet)\n\n4. change Forced Camera Near Distance to anything else\n\nI would expect to see the skybox but it's just black. Rejoining fixes it.",
